<p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500">Sleeping and parking limits are guidance only. Leave occupancy blank to use configured bed spaces; exceeding guidance warns without blocking a stay.</p>
<fieldset class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3"><legend class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold">Rental season and parking</legend>
  <div><%= form.label :season_start, 'Season start', class: 'block text-sm font-medium' %><%= form.date_field :season_start, class: 'mt-2 block w-full rounded border-gray-300' %></div>
  <div><%= form.label :season_end, 'Season end', class: 'block text-sm font-medium' %><%= form.date_field :season_end, class: 'mt-2 block w-full rounded border-gray-300' %></div>
  <div><%= form.label :max_cars, 'Parking spaces', class: 'block text-sm font-medium' %><%= form.number_field :max_cars, min: 0, class: 'mt-2 block w-full rounded border-gray-300' %></div>
</fieldset>

<div class="mt-4"><%= form.label :layout_reference_url, 'Private room diagram / layout link (HTTPS)' %><%= form.url_field :layout_reference_url, class: 'mt-2 w-full rounded border' %></div>
